# Megatron-Bridge grouped expert LoRA patch
#
# Apply from the Megatron-Bridge repo root:
#   git apply /workspace/src/RL/tools/runpod/megatron_bridge_grouped_lora.patch
#
# Or from /workspace/src/RL:
#   bash tools/runpod/apply_megatron_bridge_grouped_lora_patch.sh
#
# Purpose:
# - Include TE grouped expert linear layers in PEFT target_modules=[] matching.
# - Add per-expert LoRA weights for grouped MoE linear layers while keeping grouped GEMM.
# - Export 3D grouped expert LoRA weights to HF PEFT per-expert keys.
# - Keep the local moe_grouped_gemm toggle in the Mamba provider path.

